00:40:05,103 --> 00:40:06,771
TOWARDS BECOMING AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

1171
00:40:07,505 --> 00:40:08,773
Catie: THANK YOU.

1172
00:40:10,375 --> 00:40:11,709
Tyra: WILL XIOMARA AND HEATHER
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

1173
00:40:20,251 --> 00:40:22,353
Tyra: HEATHER,
THE JUDGES HAVE CONTINUED

1174
00:40:22,353 --> 00:40:24,022
TO LOOK AT
YOUR PICTURES,

1175
00:40:24,022 --> 00:40:27,792
AND SOMETIMES WE THINK YOU
MAY LOOK A LITTLE TOO TEEN.

1176
00:40:27,792 --> 00:40:29,861
SOME FEEL LIKE IT MIGHT
BE JUST A BABYNESS.

1177
00:40:29,861 --> 00:40:31,062
WE'RE NOT SURE IF
IT HAS TO DO

1178
00:40:31,062 --> 00:40:32,964
WITH YOU
BEING 18 YEARS OLD

1179
00:40:32,964 --> 00:40:36,200
OR IF THAT'S JUST
YOUR LOOK.

1180
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:40,071
XIOMARA, ONE THING THAT
THE JUDGES DON'T UNDERSTAND

1181
00:40:40,071 --> 00:40:42,540
IS HOW YOU COULD LET THE
ATTENTION THAT ANOTHER GIRL

1182
00:40:42,540 --> 00:40:45,510
IS GETTING
RUIN YOUR CHANCES

1183
00:40:45,510 --> 00:40:47,879
AT WINNING THIS
COMPETITION.

1184
00:40:47,879 --> 00:40:49,080
WE THINK THIS WAS
YOUR WEAKEST

1185
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:51,349
WEEK SINCE
YOU'VE BEEN HERE.

1186
00:40:51,349 --> 00:40:52,517
WHOEVER'S NAME I
DO NOT CALL

1187
00:40:52,517 --> 00:40:56,821
MUST IMMEDIATELY GO
BACK TO THE LOFT

1188
00:40:56,821 --> 00:40:58,556
AND PACK YOUR
BELONGINGS AND LEAVE.

1189
00:41:08,266 --> 00:41:09,667
Tyra: XIOMARA.

1190
00:41:09,667 --> 00:41:11,102
CONGRATULATIONS.

1191
00:41:11,102 --> 00:41:12,770
Xiomara: (cries)

1192
00:41:17,375 --> 00:41:19,177
Tyra: YOU'RE GONNA
MAKE ME CRY, TOO.

1193
00:41:19,177 --> 00:41:20,611
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1194
00:41:20,611 --> 00:41:23,414
AMERICA'S NEXT
TOP MODEL.

1195
00:41:23,414 --> 00:41:25,650
Xiomara: THANK YOU.

1196
00:41:25,650 --> 00:41:29,287
♪♪♪

1197
00:41:40,264 --> 00:41:43,134
Heather: I AM
JUST STUNNED, SHOCKED.

1198
00:41:43,134 --> 00:41:45,136
I KNOW THAT
I'M PRETTIER

1199
00:41:45,136 --> 00:41:46,137
THAN A LOT
OF THOSE GIRLS

1200
00:41:46,137 --> 00:41:47,672
STANDING UP THERE.

1201
00:41:47,672 --> 00:41:49,774
SO I'M GOING TO
CONTINUE TRYING,

1202
00:41:49,774 --> 00:41:53,111
AND I'M NOT GONNA LET
THIS DRAG ME DOWN.

1203
00:41:53,111 --> 00:41:54,112
SOMEONE ELSE
WILL LIKE ME.

1204
00:41:54,112 --> 00:41:55,380
YOU KNOW,
ONE MAN'S TRASH

1205
00:41:55,380 --> 00:41:56,381
IS ANOTHER MAN'S TREASURE.

1206
00:41:56,381 --> 00:41:57,882
OBVIOUSLY,
I'M TRASH HERE,

1207
00:41:57,882 --> 00:41:59,317
AND I'LL BE
A TREASURE SOMEWHERE ELSE.

1208
00:42:02,053 --> 00:42:05,423
♪♪♪

1209
00:42:11,863 --> 00:42:13,364
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1210
00:42:17,235 --> 00:42:20,271
HERE'S WHAT'S COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1211
00:42:20,271 --> 00:42:22,840
A SURPRISE VISITOR
SHAKES THINGS UP.

1212
00:42:22,840 --> 00:42:26,477
Yoanna: OUR GUEST IS LAST
YEAR'S WINNER--ADRIANNE.

1213
00:42:26,477 --> 00:42:29,213
Tyra: AND CATIE'S
HAD ENOUGH.

1214
00:42:29,213 --> 00:42:30,782
Catie: THE PAST THREE DAYS
HAVE BEEN THE WORST DAYS

1215
00:42:30,782 --> 00:42:31,783
OF MY LIFE.

1216
00:42:31,783 --> 00:42:33,284
I REALLY JUST WANT
TO GO HOME.

1217
00:42:33,284 --> 00:42:35,520
Tyra: WHILE
MERCEDES COPES

1218
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:37,422
WITH A SERIOUS ILLNESS.

1219
00:42:37,422 --> 00:42:39,557
Mercedes: THERE'S SO MUCH
COMING OUT, AND I'M SCARED.

